hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1489","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab aur Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne farmaya: 'Shuf'a us mein hai jo taqseem nahin hua, jab hudood waqe ho jaen to shuf'a nahin hai.'"
"1490","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl ya is ke hum-ma'na jo is ki mukhalifat nahin karta."
"1491","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Shuf'a us mein hai jo taqseem nahin hua, jab hudood waqe ho jaen to shuf'a nahin hai.'"
"1492","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Unhen Sufyan ne khabar di, Ibrahim bin Maisarah se, Amr bin Sharid se, Abu Rafi' se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Padosi apne shuf'e ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"1493","[AI-translation] Malik ne unhen Amr bin Yahya Mazini se, apne walid se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Na nuqsan hai aur na nuqsan pahunchaana hai.'"
"1494","[AI-translation] A'raj se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi apne padosi ko apni deewar mein lakdi gaadne se na roke.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir Abu Hurairah kahte: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhen is se munh phere hue dekhta hun? Allah ki qasam! Main ise tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan phenkta rahunga."
"1495","[AI-translation] Yahya Mazini ke walid se riwayat hai ke Zahhak bin Khalifah ne Aridh se apni ek nahar nikali aur use Muhammad bin Maslamah ki zameen se guzarna chaha to Muhammad bin Maslamah ne inkar kar diya. Zahhak ne is bare mein Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se baat ki. To unhon ne Muhammad bin Maslamah ko bulaya aur unhen us ka rasta chhorne ka hukm diya. Muhammad bin Maslamah ne kaha: Nahin. To Umar ne farmaya: Tum apne bhai ko woh kyun rokte ho jo us ke liye nafa bakhsh hai jabke woh tumhare liye bhi nafa bakhsh hai: Tum is se pahle bhi piyoge aur baad mein bhi aur woh tumhen nuqsan nahin dega. To Muhammad bin Maslamah ne kaha: Nahin. To Umar ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Yeh zaroor guzregi agarche tumhare pet par se hi kyun na guzre."
"1496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne bacha hua pani is liye roka ke is se ghaas roke to Allah Ta'ala qayamat ke din us se apni rahmat ka bacha hua rok lenge.'"
"1497","[AI-translation] Urwah ke walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne murda zameen ko zinda kiya to woh usi ki hai, aur zalim nas ka koi haq nahin hai.'"
"1498","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Jis ne murda zameen ko zinda kiya to woh usi ki hai."
"1499","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne zameen ke murda hisse ko zinda kiya to woh usi ka hai, aur qadeem zameen Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke liye hai phir woh meri taraf se tumhare liye hai.'"
"1500","[AI-translation] Urwah ke walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne murda zameen ko zinda kiya to woh usi ka hai, aur zalim nas ka koi haq nahin hai.'"
"1501","[AI-translation] Alqamah bin Nazlah se riwayat hai ke Abu Sufyan bin Harb apne ghar ke sehan mein khade hue phir apna paon mara aur kaha: Zameen ki choti, beshak us ki ek choti hai. Ibn Farqad Aslami ne samjha ke main apna haq us ke haq se nahin pahchanta: Mere liye Marwah ki safedi aur us ke liye us ki siyahi hai, aur mere liye falan se falan tak hai. To yeh baat Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) tak pahunchi to unhon ne farmaya: Kisi ke liye kuch nahin siwae us ke jise us ki deewaren ghere hue hon. Beshak murda zameen ko zinda karna woh hai jo kheti ho, ya khodai ho, ya deewaron se ghera ho aur woh tahjeer ko batil karne ki misl hai, yani jo us se aabad kare jaise woh tahjeer kare."
"1502","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Ja'dah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae to logon ko ghar taqseem kiye. To Banu Zuhrah ke ek qabile ne jinhen Banu Abd bin Zuhrah kaha jata tha kaha: Ham se Ibn Umm Abd ko door karo. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To phir Allah ne mujhe kyun bheja hai? Beshak Allah us ummat ko paak nahin karte jis mein kamzor ka haq na liya jae.'"
"1503","[AI-translation] Hisham se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zubair ko zameen ka tukda diya aur Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Aqiq sara taqseem kiya, aur farmaya: Zameen mangne wale kahan hain? Aur Aqiq Madinah ke qareeb hai."
"1504","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se, Sa'b bin Jassamah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koi hima nahin siwae Allah aur Us ke Rasool ke liye.'"
"1505","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Hunayy naam ke apne ek ghulam ko hima par muqarrar kiya, to un se farmaya: Aey Hunayy! Apne baazu samet lo, aur mazloom ki baddua se daro, kyunke mazloom ki dua qubool hoti hai. Thodi oontniyon aur thodi bakriyon wale ko andar aane do. Aur mujhe Ibn Affan aur Ibn Auf ke oonton se door rakho, kyunke woh donon agar un ke maweshi halak ho jaen to khajoor aur kheti ki taraf laut jaenge, aur thodi bakriyon wala apne ghar walon ke sath aaega aur kahega: Ya Ameerul Momineen, Ya Ameerul Momineen, to kya main unhen chhor dun? Tumhara baap na ho, to pani aur ghaas deenar aur dirham se halka hai. Allah ki qasam, shayad woh samajhte hain ke main ne un par zulm kiya hai: Beshak yeh un ki zameen hai, unhon ne jahiliyat mein is par jangen ladeen aur Islam mein is par Islam lae. Aur agar woh maal na hota jise main Allah Ta'ala ki rah mein sawaron par uthata hun to main Musalmanon ki zameen mein se kuch bhi hima na banata."
